== About me
I am a tenured Associate Professor in the area of {{<a href="https://www.hkubs.hku.hk/people/xinghao-qiao/" target="_blank"> Innovation and Information Management </a>}} at HKU Business School.\n
Prior to HKU, I was a tenured Associate Professor in the {{<a href="https://www.lse.ac.uk/statistics" target="_blank">Department of Statistics</a>}} at the London School of Economics, U.K.

I am also part of the {{<a href="https://hkubs-stat.github.io" target="_blank">Business Analytics Group</a>}} at HKU Business School.

*News*:\n
HKU Business School (our {{<a href="https://hkubs-stat.github.io" target="_blank">Business Analytics Group</a>}}) and the School of Computing and Data Science invite applications for a joint tenure-track appointment at the rank of Assistant Professor\/Associate Professor\/Professor in Statistics, AI, and Data Science. This is an AI+Business hire.
For details and application, please {{<a href="https://jobs.hku.hk/cw/en/job/536106/tenuretrack-professorassociate-professorassistant-professor-in-hku-business-school-and-the-school-of-computing-and-data-science" target="_blank"> click here</a>}}.

*Opportunities*:\n
I am actively recruiting PhD students and summer interns who have strong mathematical and statistical background and a genuine curiosity in modern statistics, econometrics and data science. \n
Please consider sending me an email with your CV, and applying to our {{<a href="https://phd.hkubs.hku.hk/" target="_blank">PhD program</a>}}. For more information, see the {{<a href="application_info.pdf" target="_blank">PhD recruitment slides</a>}}.

== Education

- PhD in Business Administration ({{<a href="https://usc-dso-stat-group.github.io/" target="_blank">Statistics</a>}}), Marshall School of Business, University of Southern California, USA\n
\- Advisor: {{<a href="https://www.garethmjames.com/" target="_blank">Gareth James</a>}}
- MS in {{<a href="https://stat.uchicago.edu/" target="_blank">Statistics</a>}}, University of Chicago, USA
- BS in {{<a href="https://www.math.tsinghua.edu.cn/" target="_blank">Mathematics</a>}} and {{<a href="https://www.phys.tsinghua.edu.cn/" target="_blank">Physics</a>}}, Tsinghua University, China

== Research interests

- Causal inference and experimental design 
- Complex time series analysis
- High-dimensional statistics/econometrics
- Statistical foundations of LLMs
- Functional data analysis 

